id=hy300-clean
name=HY300 clean
version=v14
versionCode=14
author=local
description=Stubs qw, appsdisable, gmsopt, preinstall, runin.sh and product_update_oem.sh; removes StoreOS, the OTA updater and the screensaver; patches the vendor SELinux policy and enforces it; Google NTP and connectivity checks instead of Chinese servers; remote input button toggles HDMI, cast button toggles Settings, holding the mouse button opens keystone adjustment.
